<pre class=metadata>
Title: Reduced Power Preference Media Query
Shortname: prefers-reduced-power
Level: none
Status: LD
ED: https://arronei.github.io/CSS-Additions/system-media-queries/power-saver/spec/
Repository: arronei/CSS-Additions
Editor: Arron Eicholz
Abstract: This specification adds the '@media/prefers-reduced-power' media feature, which reports that
    the user's device is saving power, as it does when Low Power Mode, Battery Saver, or Energy Saver is
    on, so that pages can turn off video backgrounds, heavy animation, and background work. It reports
    whether a power-saving mode is on, never a battery level, and it uses delayed change delivery so that
    a change can't link the user's visits to different sites.
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes, css yes
Complain About: accidental-2119 no, missing-example-ids yes
Assume Explicit For: yes
</pre>

